# No environment variables are required: the extension has no build-time secrets
# and needs no API key to work (users add optional AI keys in the options page).
#
# If you add build-time values later, put them in .env.local (git-ignored) and
# prefix them with WXT_ or VITE_ so they are exposed via import.meta.env.
#
# To choose which browser `pnpm dev` opens, copy web-ext.config.example.ts to
# web-ext.config.ts (git-ignored) and set the binary paths there.
